## Caveats

- This report reflects the state of the provided dataset only — retraining or data drift requires a rerun.
- Statistical fairness metrics don't capture everything that matters ethically. Use this as evidence for judgment, not as a pass/fail stamp.
- Small group sizes (n < 30) should be interpreted with caution; confidence intervals are wide.
